    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6822" root="جيش" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْشَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A single rising,</i> or <i>heaving,</i> or <i>the like:</i>
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْشَاتٌ</span>: hence the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْشَاتُ الأَبَاطِيلِ</span>
[app. meaning <i>The risings of false</i> or <i>vain things</i>
in the mind, or the like]. (TA.)

